cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Contour_Maker: YOLO-Seg vs Det-UNet vs RF-DETR-Seg for instance segmentation"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible comparison of three instance-segmentation schemes (YOLO26n-seg,
  YOLO26n-det + MK-UNet, and RF-DETR-Seg-Nano) on ultrasound lesion data and a
  10-class ADE20K indoor-object subset. Training is done in PyTorch and
  deployment in C++/MNN.
authors:
